ns using residual vector quantization and knowledge distillation, enabling high‑quality audio generation at low bitrate and low framerate [S1][S3]. The third component is a **Depth‑Transformer‑based multi‑stream hierarchy**, which streams and jointly models separate token streams for the user’s speech and Moshi’s output (semantic and acoustic tokens), allowing full‑duplex, real‑time dialogue without explicit speaker‑turn modeling [S1][S3]. The fourth element is **Inner Monologue**, a training and inference procedure that prefixes audio token generation with text tokens, letting Moshi exploit its text‑only knowledge while remaining compatible with streaming inference [S1][S2][S3].", "reasoning_chars": 508}}
